# Lychee ignore list (regular expressions).
# These are GitHub web-UI shortcuts: they resolve on github.com but not as
# local filesystem paths, so skip them during offline link checking.
\.\./\.\./issues
\.\./\.\./discussions
\.\./\.\./pulls
\.\./\.\./security
\.\./\.\./compare
\.\./\.\./releases

